  concept: 'Authored objective: Recover three VRM faults.

    Authored requirement:
    Measure and repair Phase 2 sense drift, the Phase 3 output via and added Phase
    4 thermal loss.

    General teaching principle: Electrical measurements are
    differences or flows that require a correct reference, operating condition and
    fresh solver evidence.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish
    that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: A pressure gauge needs a reference; a voltage measurement likewise depends
    on its defined points.
